Feature: Circles and routes
  The ground station and the app give the same orders. Besides a tower, a point and HOLD or HOME,
  you can send a drone to circle a point at the distance that you choose, and you can give it a
  route of points to fly one after the other.

  To circle a point, select the drones and press CIRCLE, or C. Press the mouse on the point, and
  drag out to the distance. The battlefield shows the circle while you drag. Let go of the mouse,
  and the drones go there and circle the point at that distance. A circle is between 30 m and
  300 m wide, measured from its centre.

  To give a route, hold Shift and right-click each point in turn. The first right-click sends the
  drones to the first point. Each one after that adds a point at the end of the route. The drones
  fly to each point in turn, and they circle the last one. The battlefield shows the route as a
  dashed line with a number at each point. Any other order ends the route.

  Expectation: CIRCLE sends the selected drone to circle a point at the distance that you drag
    Given the selected drone is the first Blue drone
    When the commander draws a circle of 120 m on the battlefield
    Then the order of the first Blue drone is circle a point
    And the radius of the circle of the first Blue drone is at least 100 m
    And the radius of the circle of the first Blue drone is at most 140 m
    And the points in the route of the first Blue drone are 0

  Expectation: A drone sent to circle a point flies round it at that distance
    Given the selected drone is the first Blue drone
    And the order of the first Blue drone is circle a point
    When the game runs for 2 minutes
    Then the distance of the first Blue drone from the centre of its circle is at least 80 m
    And the distance of the first Blue drone from the centre of its circle is at most 170 m

  Expectation: Shift and a right-click start the route of the selected drone
    The first point is the drone's goal at once.

    Given the selected drone is the first Blue drone
    And the points in the route of the first Blue drone are 0
    When the commander adds a point to the route of the selected drone
    Then the points in the route of the first Blue drone are 1
    And the order of the first Blue drone is go to a point

  Expectation: Shift and a right-click again add a point at the end of the route
    The points after the first wait for their turn.

    Given the selected drone is the first Blue drone
    And the points in the route of the first Blue drone are 1
    When the commander adds a point to the route of the selected drone
    Then the points in the route of the first Blue drone are 2

  Expectation: A drone flies its route one point after the other
    Each time that it gets to a point, the drone goes on to the next. At the last point it circles.

    Given the points in the route of the first Blue drone are 2
    When the game runs for 2 minutes
    Then the points in the route of the first Blue drone are 1

  Expectation: Any other order ends the route
    Given the selected drone is the first Blue drone
    When the commander sends the selected drone to the west tower
    Then the points in the route of the first Blue drone are 0
